// GENERATED FILE - DO NOT EDIT
// Shared-lattice tables for the snowflake-n single-FPGA build
//   repetition d=3, 2 slices, window 3 layers, box 1x4, P=16
//   NSLOT=32 node slots, 40 edge slots, 2 slices, 12 graph nodes, 13 edges
// generated by fpga_flow/make_lattice_sim.py from the same localuf tables
//   [PAD x4] SPATIAL box padded: the array instantiates 4 x as many node/edge slots
//   and every added slot has *_VALID = 0 in every context (folding experiment).
//   real spatial positions: P_REAL=4 of P=16
// as design/generated/snowflake_graph.svh
